  npcName: NPC
  dialogueLines:
  - HELPPPPP, oh my didnt see you there
  - The city has been over run by sugar... its everywhere
  - They took out the bridge, there are some buttons around here that can be shot
    to get the bridge up and working again
  - Do you think you can get the bridge working again? I also heard rumor of a secret
    entrance but no one told me where to find it I feel like im close though
  - Thank you for your help!  Good luck chef
